    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_242.variants.schinzel_generalization\n    (a : ℕ) (ha : 0 < a) :\n    ∀ᶠ (n : ℕ) in Filter.atTop, ∃ x y z : ℕ, 1 ≤ x ∧ x < y ∧ y < z ∧\n      (a / n : ℚ) = 1 / x + 1 / y + 1 / z",
